cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this hardening framework, ephemeral KVM sandbox architecture, or benchmark collector in research or security audits, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Techdim Debian 13 Hardening Framework & Ephemeral KVM Sandbox (Kether_1)"
abstract: "Reproducible Zero Trust and CIS Benchmark Level 2 hardening framework for Debian 13 (Trixie) workstations and servers executing autonomous AI agents without breaking unprivileged user namespaces (userns) or eBPF. Includes deterministic hardening guidance, AppArmor confinement policies, auditd telemetry, ephemeral QCOW2/KVM sandbox isolation, and a reproducible read-only metrics collector."
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license: "MIT"
